1
00:06:04,444 --> 00:06:10,444
We all share the same fate.

2
00:12:08,888 --> 00:12:14,888
Mission: Impossible - Dead Reckoning Part One is a action, thriller,
adventure film directed by Christopher McQuarrie.

3
00:18:13,333 --> 00:18:19,333
Ethan Hunt and his IMF team embark on their most dangerous mission yet: To track down a terrifying
new weapon that threatens all of humanity before it falls into the wrong hands.

4
00:24:17,777 --> 00:24:23,777
With control of the future and the world's fate at stake and dark forces from
Ethan's past closing in, a deadly race around the globe begins.

5
00:30:22,222 --> 00:30:28,222
Confronted by a mysterious, all-powerful enemy, Ethan must consider that nothing can
matter more than his mission—not even the lives of those he cares about most.

6
00:36:26,666 --> 00:36:32,666
Ethan Hunt, played by Tom Cruise.

7
00:42:31,111 --> 00:42:37,111
Grace, played by Hayley Atwell.

8
00:48:35,555 --> 00:48:41,555
Luther Stickell, played by Ving Rhames.

9
00:54:40,000 --> 00:54:46,000
Benji Dunn, played by Simon Pegg.

10
01:00:44,444 --> 01:00:50,444
Ilsa Faust, played by Rebecca Ferguson.

11
01:06:48,888 --> 01:06:54,888
The White Widow, played by Vanessa Kirby.

12
01:12:53,333 --> 01:12:59,333
Mission: Impossible – Dead Reckoning Part One is a 2023 American action spy film directed
by Christopher McQuarrie from a screenplay he co-wrote with Erik Jendresen.

13
01:18:57,777 --> 01:19:03,777
It is the sequel to Mission: Impossible – Fallout (2018) and the
seventh installment in the Mission: Impossible film series.

14
01:25:02,222 --> 01:25:08,222
The ensemble cast includes Tom Cruise, Hayley Atwell, Ving Rhames, Simon Pegg, Rebecca Ferguson,
Vanessa Kirby, Esai Morales, Pom Klementieff, Mariela Garriga and Henry Czerny.

15
01:31:06,666 --> 01:31:12,666
In the film, Impossible Missions Force agent Ethan Hunt (Cruise) and his team face
off against the Entity, a powerful rogue artificial intelligence.

16
01:37:11,111 --> 01:37:17,111
In January 2019, Cruise announced the next two Mission: Impossible films would
be shot back-to-back, with McQuarrie writing and directing both.

17
01:43:15,555 --> 01:43:21,555
Returning and new cast members were announced soon after, and Lorne
Balfe, who composed the score for Fallout, returned to score.

18
01:49:20,000 --> 01:49:26,000
Filming began in Italy in February 2020 but was halted by the COVID-19 pandemic.

19
01:55:24,444 --> 01:55:30,444
It resumed later that year and wrapped in September 2021, with other filming
locations including Norway, the United Kingdom and the United Arab Emirates.

20
02:01:28,888 --> 02:01:34,888
With an estimated gross budget of $291 million, including a net $220
million budget, it is one of the most expensive films ever made.

21
02:07:33,333 --> 02:07:39,333
Mission: Impossible – Dead Reckoning Part One premiered in Rome on June 19, 2023, and was
theatrically released in the United States on July 12, by Paramount Pictures.

22
02:13:37,777 --> 02:13:43,777
The film received critical acclaim and grossed $571.1 million worldwide, becoming the
tenth-highest-grossing film of 2023, but was still considered to be a box-office disappointment.

23
02:19:42,222 --> 02:19:48,222
It was nominated in two categories at the 96th Academy
Awards and the 77th British Academy Film Awards.

24
02:25:46,666 --> 02:25:52,666
A direct sequel, Mission: Impossible – The Final
Reckoning, was released in May 2025.

25
02:31:51,111 --> 02:31:57,111
The film explores themes of mask, race against
time, mission, rome, italy, chase.

26
02:37:55,555 --> 02:38:01,555
The tone is dark and intense.
